		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕπν-ττω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be sleepy</i> or <i>drowsy,</i>
			
